WEBVTT

00:00:28.836 --> 00:00:33.916
No meat, no fish, no dairy milk
or eggs are used at all.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:35.556
Just amazing plants.

00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:39.196
Vegetarianism also
doesn't contain animals or fish,

00:00:39.236 --> 00:00:40.996
but allows dairy and eggs,

00:00:40.996 --> 00:00:43.236
the byproducts taken from animals.

00:00:43.716 --> 00:00:46.436
Here are a couple of vegan things
that I've made recently.

00:00:46.476 --> 00:00:48.356
A steak? No way.

00:00:48.396 --> 00:00:51.036
Actually, there are no T-bones about this.

00:00:51.076 --> 00:00:52.796
It's made of lion's mane mushrooms,

00:00:52.836 --> 00:00:56.076
the barbecue butter sauce,
cast-iron seared,

00:00:56.076 --> 00:00:58.436
one of the most nutritious
mushrooms on Earth

00:00:58.476 --> 00:01:00.476
and known to be brain-boosting.